atom     containers/flat-is-idempotent
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      [{X}].flat.elems  ===  [{X}].flat.flat.elems
why      flattening twice is flattening once
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:flat-is-idempotent
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); [1].flat.elems }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); [1].flat.flat.elems }

